Read `AGENTS.md` before a change. Full rules live there.

1. Every change has a GitHub issue. The PR body says `Closes #N`.
2. Update `docs/STATUS.md` in the same PR.
3. Do not merge without Tony's approval. Do not deploy. Do not run `wrangler login`. Do not touch cloud accounts, secrets, or paid services.
4. Before a large refactor, use the arcade-agent MCP (`context_for_task`, then `diff_impact`). Config: `.cursor/mcp.json`.
